{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-eph-5-1","title":"Ephesians 5:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EPH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 After general exhortations to love; 3 to flee fornication; 4 and all uncleanness; 7 not to converse with the wicked; 15 to walk warily; 18 and to be filled with the Spirit; 22 he descends to the particular duties, how wives ought to obey their husbands; 25 and husbands ought to love their wives, 32 even as Christ does his church.</p>\n<p>followers. 4:32; Le 11:45; Mt 5:45,48; Lu 6:35,36; 1Pe 1:15,16; 1Jo 4:11 as. Jer 31:20; Ho 1:10; Joh 1:12; Col 3:12; 1Jo 3:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-eph-5-2","title":"Ephesians 5:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EPH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>walk. 3:17; 4:2,15; Joh 13:34; Ro 14:16; 1Co 16:14; Col 3:14; 1Th 4:9 1Ti 4:12; 1Pe 4:8; 1Jo 3:11,12,23; 4:20,21 as. 25; 3:19; Mt 20:28; Joh 15:12,13; 2Co 5:14,15; 8:9; Ga 1:4; 2:20 1Ti 2:6; Tit 2:14; Heb 7:25-27; 9:14,26; 10:10,11; 1Pe 2:21-24 1Jo 3:16; Re 1:5; 5:9 a sacrifice. Ro 8:3; *marg: 1Co 5:7; Heb 9:23; 10:12 for a. Ge 8:21; Le 1:9,13,17; 3:16; Am 5:21; 2Co 2:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-eph-5-3","title":"Ephesians 5:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EPH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>fornication. 5; 4:19,20; Nu 25:1; De 23:17,18; Mt 15:19; Mr 7:21; Ac 15:20 Ro 1:29; 6:13; 1Co 5:10,11; 6:9,13,18; 10:8; 2Co 12:21; Ga 5:19-21 Col 3:5; 1Th 4:3,7; Heb 12:16; 13:4; 2Pe 2:10; Re 2:14,21; 9:21; 21:8 Re 22:15 covetousness. 5; Ex 18:21; 20:17; Jos 7:21; 1Sa 8:3; Ps 10:3; 119:36; Pr 28:16 Jer 6:13; 8:10; 22:17; Eze 33:31; Mic 2:2; Mr 7:22; Lu 12:15; 16:14 Ac 20:33; 1Co 6:10; Col 3:5; 1Ti 3:3; 6:10; 2Ti 3:2; Tit 1:7,11 Heb 13:5; 1Pe 5:2; 2Pe 2:3,14 named. 12; Ex 23:13; 1Co 5:1 as. Ro 16:2; Php 1:27; 1Ti 2:10; Tit 2:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-eph-5-4","title":"Ephesians 5:4","author":"R. A. T