r, it. Awake. Isa 51:17; 52:1; 60:1; Ro 13:11,12; 1Co 15:34; 1Th 5:6 2Ti 2:26; *marg: arise. 2:5; Isa 26:19; Eze 37:4-10; Joh 5:25-29; 11:43,44; Ro 6:4,5,13 Col 3:1 Christ. Joh 8:12; 9:5; Ac 13:47; 2Co 4:6; 2Ti 1:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-eph-5-15","title":"Ephesians 5:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EPH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>See. 33; Mt 8:4; 27:4,24; 1Th 5:15; Heb 12:25; 1Pe 1:22; Re 19:10 walk. Ex 23:13; Mt 10:16; 1Co 14:20; Php 1:27; Col 1:9; 4:5 not. 2Sa 24:10; Job 2:10; Ps 73:22; Pr 14:8; Mt 25:2; Lu 24:25 Ga 3:1,3; 1Ti 6:9; Jas 3:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-eph-5-16","title":"Ephesians 5:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EPH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Redeeming. Ec 9:10; Ro 13:11; Ga 6:10; Col 4:5 the days. 6:13,15; Ps 37:19; Ec 11:2; 12:1; Am 5:13; Joh 12:35; Ac 11:28,29 1Co 7:26,29-31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-eph-5-17","title":"Ephesians 5:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EPH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>be. 15; Col 4:5 understanding. De 4:6; 1Ki 3:9-12; Job 28:28; Ps 111:10; 119:27; Pr 2:5; 14:8; 23:23 Jer 4:22; Joh 7:17; Ro 12:2; Col 1:9; 1Th 4:1-3; 5:18; 1Pe 4:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-eph-5-18","title":"Ephesians 5:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EPH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>be not. Ge 9:21; 19:32-35; De 21:20; Ps 69:12; Pr 20:1; 23:20,21,29-35 Isa 5:11-13,22; Mt 24:49; Lu 12:45; 21:34; Ro 13:13; 1Co 5:11; 6:10 1Co 11:21; Ga 5:21; 1Th 5:7 excess. Mt 23:25; 1Pe 4:3,4 but. Ps 63:3-5; So 1:4; 7:9; Isa 25:6; 55:1; Zec 9:15-17; Lu 11:13 Ac 2:13-18; 11:24; Ga 5:22-25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-eph-5-19","title":"Ephesians 5:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EPH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>to yourselves. Ac 16:25; 1Co 14:26; Col 3:16; Jas 5:13 psalms.Psalms, [psalmos ,] from [psallo ,] to touch or play on a musical instrument, properly denotes such sacred songs or poems as are sung to stringed instruments, and may here refer to those of David; hymns, [humnos ,] from [hudo,] to sing, celebrate, praise, signifies songs in honour of God; and songs [ode ,] from [aeido,] to sing, denotes any regular poetic composition adapted to singing, and is here restricted to those which are spiritual.</p>\n<p>Ps 95:2; 105:2; Mt 26:30 making. Ps 47:7,8; 62:8; 86:12; 105:3; 147:7; Isa 65:14; Mt 15:8; Joh 4:23,24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-eph-5-20","title":"Ephesians 5:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EPH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>thanks. 4; Job 1:21; Ps 34:1; Isa 63:7; Ac 5:41; 1Co 1:4; Php 1:3; 4:6 Col 1:11,12; 3:17; 1Th 3:9; 5:18; 2Th 1:3; 2:13 in. Joh 14:13,14; 15:16; 16:23-26; Col 3:17; Heb 13:15; 1Pe 2:5; 4:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-eph-5-21","title":"Ephesians 5:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EPH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>submitting. 22,24; Ge 16:9; 1Ch 29:24; Ro 13:1-5; 1Co 16:16; Php 2:3; 1Ti 2:11 1Ti 3:4; Heb 13:17; 1Pe 2:13; 5:5 in. 2Ch 19:7; Ne 5:9,15; Pr 24:21; 2Co 7:1; 1Pe 2:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-eph-5-22","title":"Ephesians 5:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EPH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>submit. 24; Ge 3:16; Es 1:16-18,20; 1Co 14:34; Col 3:18-25; 1Ti 2:11,12 Tit 2:5; 1Pe 3:1-6 as. 6:5; Col 3:22,23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-eph-5-23","title":"Ephesians 5:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EPH","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>husband. 1Co 11:3-10 even. 1:22,23; 4:15; Col 1:18 he. 25,26; Ac 20:28; 1Th 1:10; Re 5:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-eph-5-24","title":"Ephesians 5:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EPH